@startuml fig3_10_invigilator_scheduling
' Figure 3.10 - Sequence Diagram (Part 6): Invigilator schedule generation, review and save.
' Same lifelines and look as Figs 3.5-3.9.
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam SequenceLifeLineBorderColor #999999
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #666666
skinparam SequenceDividerBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #B8A04A
hide stereotype
skinparam participant {
  BackgroundColor<<ui>> #FDEDEC
  BorderColor<<ui>> #C0392B
  BackgroundColor<<api>> #EAF7EA
  BorderColor<<api>> #2E8B57
  BackgroundColor<<alg>> #FEF5E7
  BorderColor<<alg>> #D68910
}

actor Admin
participant "React UI" as UI <<ui>>
participant "Express API" as API <<api>>
participant "Algorithm Engine" as ALG <<alg>>
database MySQL as DB

== 7 · Invigilator Scheduling ==

Admin -> UI : Open "Invigilator Scheduling"
UI -> API : GET /invigilator-scheduling/progress
API -> DB : COUNT slots with exams, seated slots,\nrole targets, duties, unstaffed rooms
DB --> API : counts
API --> UI : { steps }
UI -> UI : Render progress tracker\n(Seating ready → Duty targets set →\nSchedule saved → All rooms staffed)

Admin -> UI : Enter duties per role
UI -> API : PUT /role-targets { targets[] }
API -> DB : INSERT INTO invigilator_role_targets\nON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE
API --> UI : { success }

Admin -> UI : Click "Generate Draft"
UI -> API : POST /generate-preview
API -> DB : SELECT slots + students per room\n(exam_slots JOIN scheduled_exams\nJOIN seating_allocations)
API -> DB : SELECT course instructors per room\n(course_instructors JOIN users\nON employee_id)
API -> DB : SELECT invigilators + role targets\n+ overrides + sibling-period balance
DB --> API : rows
note right of API
  effective_target =
  max(0, base_target − sibling balance)
  (only when the sibling period
  already has a saved schedule)
end note
API -> ALG : runInvigilatorAlgorithm(slots, roomLoad,\ninstructors, invigilators)
activate ALG
ALG -> ALG : Phase A: place course instructors\nin rooms holding their own course
ALG -> ALG : Phase B: fill max(1, ceil(students/25))\nper room, most-behind-target first
ALG --> API : { assignments[], summary, warnings }
deactivate ALG
API --> UI : proposal (no DB write)
UI -> UI : Stage draft:\nremoves = current duties,\nadds = proposed duties

loop Manual edits (optional)
  Admin -> UI : Add / reassign / remove a duty
  UI -> API : GET /eligible?slot_id=X
  API -> DB : SELECT users not already\non duty in slot X
  API --> UI : eligible[]
end

Admin -> UI : Click "Save Changes"
UI -> API : POST /apply-changes\n{ reassigns, removes, adds }
API -> DB : BEGIN
API -> DB : DELETE removed duties
API -> DB : UPDATE reassigned duties\n(reject if person already in slot)
API -> DB : INSERT INTO invigilator_assignments\n(slot must belong to active period)
API -> DB : COMMIT
API --> UI : { applied }
UI -> API : GET /progress
API --> UI : all steps done
UI -> UI : "Invigilation schedule complete"\ndialog + next step

Admin -> UI : Past Invigilation → "Save" (name)
UI -> API : POST /sessions/save { session_name }
API -> DB : INSERT INTO invigilation_sessions
API -> DB : INSERT INTO invigilation_session_duties\n(denormalized snapshot via SELECT ... JOIN)
API --> UI : { session saved }
@enduml
